{"id":6816,"date":"2026-10-01T12:54:29","date_gmt":"2026-10-01T11:54:29","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.jouwweb.nl\/blog\/?p=6816"},"modified":"2026-10-06T11:46:22","modified_gmt":"2026-10-06T10:46:22","slug":"4-simple-ways-to-capitalize-on-halloween","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/4-simple-ways-to-capitalize-on-halloween\/","title":{"rendered":"4 Simple Ways to Capitalize on Halloween"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Halloween is becoming more popular every year, and although you might not immediately think of Halloween as a sales opportunity, this holiday does offer chances.<br>You also don&#8217;t need to completely overhaul your webshop to capitalize on Halloween. With just a few small adjustments, you can ensure that your website gets visitors into the Halloween spirit.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In this blog, we share 4 simple ways to make your Webador site Halloween-proof.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1: Create a Special Halloween page\u00a0<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Do you have products you can give a Halloween makeover? Or do you want to offer a temporary special promotion? Then create a separate Halloween page on your website.<br>A dedicated page ensures that visitors don&#8217;t have to search through your entire webshop. All Halloween-related products, offers, and inspiration are gathered in one place.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You can dress up the entire page in Halloween style: for example, add a matching banner and make products stand out with a special Halloween\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/help.webador.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/29426754527889-Add-personalized-product-labels-to-products\">product label<\/a>\u00a0. You don&#8217;t have to overhaul your entire branding; a few small details can be enough.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">To make the page stand out, you can send visitors from the homepage to the Halloween page. For example, place a prominent\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/help.webador.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/29426750598929-Add-a-button\">button<\/a>\u00a0in your banner with the text\u00a0<em>\u201cView our Halloween Deals\u201d<\/em>\u00a0. Link the button directly to your Halloween page.\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1122\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jouwweb.nl\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/Gemini_Generated_Image_3d9z0v3d9z0v3d9z-scaled.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-6820\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/Gemini_Generated_Image_3d9z0v3d9z0v3d9z-scaled.jpeg 2560w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/Gemini_Generated_Image_3d9z0v3d9z0v3d9z-300x131.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/Gemini_Generated_Image_3d9z0v3d9z0v3d9z-1024x449.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/Gemini_Generated_Image_3d9z0v3d9z0v3d9z-768x336.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/Gemini_Generated_Image_3d9z0v3d9z0v3d9z-1536x673.jpeg 1536w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/Gemini_Generated_Image_3d9z0v3d9z0v3d9z-2048x897.jpeg 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2: Give your visitors a reason to order now<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A holiday is a good time to organize a temporary promotion. Not because you necessarily have to offer a discount, but because a temporary offer can give visitors just that extra push to make a purchase.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A simple way to draw attention to a promotion is with the\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/help.webador.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/29426738479633-Add-a-top-bar-to-your-website\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https:\/\/help.webador.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/29426738479633-Add-a-top-bar-to-your-website\">top bar<\/a>\u00a0, where you can display a specific discount.<br>You can also choose to include a small gift with an order, such as a bag of Halloween candy. If you then link a minimum order amount to this, for example starting at 50 euros, you immediately increase the customer&#8217;s order value.\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Tip:<\/strong>\u00a0ensure that the terms and conditions of your promotions are clear. State when the promotion ends, the minimum order value, and whether stock is limited.\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/blockquote>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3: Create urgency with a countdown<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Halloween is just one day, and you can use that very temporary nature to encourage visitors to make a purchase. A countdown timer on your website shows how much time is left for your promotion.\u00a0<br>You can use an external tool like\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/elfsight.com\/\">Elfsight<\/a>\u00a0for this . With their\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/elfsight.com\/countdown-timer-widget\/\">countdown widget,<\/a>\u00a0you can create a timer and then place it on your website using the\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/help.webador.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/29426708302481-Add-custom-HTML-code-to-your-website\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https:\/\/help.webador.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/29426708302481-Add-custom-HTML-code-to-your-website\">Embed code element.<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A countdown works especially well when you link it to an actual deadline. So use it for a temporary promotion, a final order date, or a Halloween offer. That way, the timer actually has meaning for your visitor.<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"464\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jouwweb.nl\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/Gemini_Generated_Image_8vltav8vltav8vlt-1024x464.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-6818\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/Gemini_Generated_Image_8vltav8vltav8vlt-1024x464.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/Gemini_Generated_Image_8vltav8vltav8vlt-300x136.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/Gemini_Generated_Image_8vltav8vltav8vlt-767x348.jpeg 767w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/Gemini_Generated_Image_8vltav8vltav8vlt-1536x697.jpeg 1536w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/Gemini_Generated_Image_8vltav8vltav8vlt-2048x929.jpeg 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4: Give your logo a Halloween twist<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text has-media-on-the-right is-stacked-on-mobile\" style=\"grid-template-columns:auto 49%\"><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left wp-block-paragraph\">Do you want to take the Halloween theme a little further? Then you can also give your logo a small update!&nbsp;<br>You don&#8217;t have to design a completely new logo for this; even a subtle adjustment can be fun. Think, for example, of a spider web, a pumpkin, or a witch&#8217;s hat.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left wp-block-paragraph\">With AI tools, you can nowadays very easily try out ideas. Upload your existing logo to an AI tool and indicate that you want to create a Halloween version of it.&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"918\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jouwweb.nl\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/Gemini_Generated_Image_2eugya2eugya2eug-1024x918.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-6819 size-full\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/Gemini_Generated_Image_2eugya2eugya2eug-1024x918.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/Gemini_Generated_Image_2eugya2eugya2eug-300x269.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/Gemini_Generated_Image_2eugya2eugya2eug-768x688.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/Gemini_Generated_Image_2eugya2eugya2eug-1536x1377.jpeg 1536w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/Gemini_Generated_Image_2eugya2eugya2eug-2048x1835.jpeg 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>For example: &#8216;Subtly add a small spiderweb and a witch&#8217;s hat to my logo. Retain the original colors, style, and recognizability of the logo.&#8217;<\/em><\/p>\n<\/blockquote>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Have you created a nice version? Then you can replace it in Webador in the places where your logo is used. Think of the website icon and\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/help.webador.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/29426705416337-Can-I-place-a-logo-and-text-at-the-top-of-my-website\">the logo on your homepage<\/a>\u00a0.\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Ready to scare your webshop?<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As a starting entrepreneur, you probably don&#8217;t have time to prepare a Halloween campaign for weeks, but fortunately, you can already make a difference with a few small adjustments!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Use Halloween primarily as an opportunity to take a fresh look at your webshop. Which products deserve some extra attention? Can you come up with a temporary promotion? And how do you give visitors that final push to place an order today?<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You don&#8217;t have to go big. Pick one or two ideas that suit your webshop, give them a creative Halloween twist, and see if it pays off. This way, you turn Halloween not only into a fun holiday but also into a great opportunity to draw extra attention to your webshop.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-light-gray-background-color has-background\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"maak-nu-jouw-website-met-jouwweb\">Build your website with Webador today!<\/h3>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:30%\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-right is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-89b4c9e9 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alignright\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"\/?utm_source=jouwweb-blog&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=cta-blok#signup-modal\">Start now<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Halloween is becoming more popular every year, and although you might not immediately think of Halloween as a